{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chicken Chasers is a silly action game where you chase chickens around different environments, each with unique challenges, while maneuvering the novel controls of a pogo stick. Your only objective is to <strong>collect all the coins in the levels</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unorthodox controls and chaotic chicken movement patterns create an enraging and engaging player experience. Chicken Chasers is designed to be a causal experience -- you can finish the levels at your own pace. There is a Steam-integrated leader board to celebrate the fastest level completion times and a multiplayer mode for extra chaos!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518050?t=1766159656","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518050?t=1766159656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518050/8a09d14d64a19791bf230ac8c89595df7871cc12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766159656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518050/8a09d14d64a19791bf230ac8c89595df7871cc12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766159656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chicken Chasers is a silly action game where you chase chickens around different environments, each with unique challenges, while maneuvering the novel controls of a pogo stick. Your only objective is to <strong>collect all the coins in the levels</strong>.</p><p class